to patents & plant varieties. | Dated 18 June 2025, the official =
examination fee for patent applications in Egypt has been increased to =
EGP 50,000, in accordance with the provisions of the Egyptian Patent Law =
No. 82 of 2002. Also, the deadline to pay examination fees has been =
officially revised to 3 months from the official notification date, =
instead of the previous 6-month period from the filing date. An =
extension can be availed by paying an additional fee of EGP 25,000.
*	UAE: Effective October 6, 2026, the UAE has officially joined the =
Locarno Agreement for industrial designs, as announced by WIPO. | USPTO =
and UAE have signed a joint agreement to expedite patent granting =
process. The UAE will now accept positive patent examination results =
from the USPTO, which will significantly speed up the patent-granting =
process in the UAE. | A Cabinet Decision has been issued in March 2025 =
detailing the establishment and operational framework for the Industrial =
Property Grievances Committee.=20
*	Zanzibar: On 18 July 2025, the Zanzibar IP Office announced the =
implementation of increased official fees, set to take effect from 11 =
August 2025. These revised fees will apply retrospectively to both new =
and pending applications, where official fees remain outstanding on or =
after this date.=20
*	Bahrain: Bahrain and Japan Sign MoU to Launch PPH Program, set to =
launch on January 1, 2026. | Bahrain PTO launched PPH Pilot Programs =
with South Korea (effective January 15, 2025, for three years) and the =
European Patent Office (commenced March 1, 2025, for an initial two =
years). | Bahrain Patent Office recently signed a Memorandum of =
Understanding (MOU) with the USPTO to implement the Patent Prosecution =
Highway (PPH) system. Bahrain has signed a Patent Prosecution Highway =
(PPH) Agreement with China. PPH pilot program officially started on May =
1, 2024, and will run for five years until April 30, 2029.=20
*	Myanmar: Myanmar=E2=80=99s Patent Law 2019 came into effect on 31 May =
2024. However, it is important to note that patent applications cannot =
yet be filed, as the issuance of patent forms and fees remains pending.
*	Qatar: MOCI announced that it has started accepting applications for =
