schedule linked to deliverables, and a draft engagement agreement before =
any deposit. * Clear allocation of responsibility between drafting =
counsel and your filing agent, including deadline monitoring, notices =
and free correction of errors attributable to the service providers. * =
The documents required from PBK and me, including any powers of =
attorney, ownership confirmations and current manager/registration =
evidence. My discussions and comments are in Russian. Please state =
whether you can provide Russian-language support and include the =
required written translations in the fixed fee for the full-service =
option. The proposed filing language is English. Completion of the =
filing stage must include the complete filed documents, official =
international application numbers and filing dates, priority particulars =
and fee-payment confirmations. Please also identify and price support =
through the international search report and written opinion. Please =
acknowledge availability urgently and, if possible, provide the =
proposal, named authorized representative, draft agreement, full cost =
breakdown and schedule by October 29, 2026. If further material is =
needed to quote, please send one consolidated list immediately. Any =
chargeable preliminary assessment must first be quoted and approved in =
writing. This is an urgent request for a proposal, not acceptance of an =
engagement, authorization for paid work or an instruction to file =
without subsequent agreement. Payments will be made only against =
official organizational invoices; additional charges require prior =
written approval. Kind regards, Mikhail Kozin PBK ENGINEERING =
